{"id":"c355ffd617fb7a9d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-edge-expander.md","title":"组合边扩张","display":"df-edge-expander — 组合边扩张","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-edge-expander","aliases":["28-df-edge-expander"],"display":"df-edge-expander — 组合边扩张","depends_on":["[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 21.7; printed p.428; PDF p.454","source_printed_pages":"428","source_pdf_pages":"454","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-edge-expander"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-edge-expander</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-edge-expander — 组合边扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 21.7; printed p.428; PDF p.454"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"428"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"454"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G(S,T)\">\\(E_G(S,T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)\\)</span> 为组合边扩张谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\subseteq[N]\\;\\left(|S|\\le N/2\\Longrightarrow|E_G(S,[N]\\setminus S)|\\ge\\rho D|S|\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\subseteq[N]\\;\\left(|S|\\le N/2\\Longrightarrow|E_G(S,[N]\\setminus S)|\\ge\\rho D|S|\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由于两个端点集不交，跨边按重数计一次，自环不计入边界。空集满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ge0\">\\(0\\ge0\\)</span>，不产生未定义比值。该定义本身不排除二分图；与绝对谱扩张的反向关系还需处理负特征值，不能仅凭本谓词断言普通游走收敛。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$E_G(S,T)$ 见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$\\rho\\in[0,1]$。$\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)$ 为组合边扩张谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"E_G(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall S\\subseteq[N]\\;\\left(|S|\\le N/2\\Longrightarrow|E_G(S,[N]\\setminus S)|\\ge\\rho D|S|\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"0\\ge0","display":false}],"bytes":1107,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"},{"id":"7e4b966bb057aaf7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$\\alpha\\in[0,1)$，$\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)$，见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]]。$\\operatorname{EdgeExp}$、$E_G$ 见 [[28-df-edge-expander]] 及其上游；$S\\subseteq[N]$，$T=[N]\\setminus S$。"}],"outgoing":["0b6b8966305e02a9"]}